{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_05_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "96f82d2cfce1d392fa1c2055d61e224eca3267b31b1d0b931b95361329b614d9", "ja": "ええ。そうよ、この子は、私。この子も、私なの。", "zh": "是的，没错，这孩子就是我。这孩子也是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
